  "newFindings": [
    "Internal DebugAPI::onNewPromise in PromiseObject::create runs after executor; it is not a public pre-executor creation hook.",
    "Public activation-behavior flags do not restore the non-Promise species capability explicitly erased to null."
  ],
  "existingSupportedMechanism": "Public JobQueue registration data propagates pending await/reaction context; general friend allocation metadata and private record discrimination powered earlier bounded experiments.",
  "engineeringDecision": "A fallible Promise-only creation attachment and explicit job/capability kind without private ABI need a versioned guest hook; this is a production policy requirement, not proof no alternative instrumented implementation is possible.",
